    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
        <p>Every car on the site gets the same treatment: the problems it's known for and what they cost to fix, step-by-step guides for the common jobs, torque specs, where to buy parts, and a buyer's guide with a printable inspection checklist. If you own one, <a href="/account/garage/">My Garage</a> will track its maintenance and restoration for you.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Where the information comes from</h2>
        <p>Workshop manuals, parts catalogs, owner forums, and specialist shops. Each issue lists its sources, and the torque tables say where their numbers came from. Repair costs and prices are rough US ranges that move with the market, so treat them as a starting point for a budget, not a quote.</p>
        <p>None of this replaces your workshop manual or a good specialist. If something here disagrees with the manual for your exact car, trust the manual and <a href="#contact">tell me</a> so I can fix it.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Corrections</h2>
        <p>These cars have a lot of variations, and owners know them better than anyone. If you spot a wrong part number, a torque value that doesn't match your manual, or a problem I've missed, send it through the form below and I'll update the page.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section">
        <h2>Not affiliated</h2>
        <p>ZRG Classics is an independent site. It isn't affiliated with or endorsed by BMW AG or Dr. Ing. h.c. F. Porsche AG. Model names are used only to identify the cars.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-contact" id="contact">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>Corrections, questions, a car you'd like to see covered, or a guide you want to contribute.</p>

        <form id="contact-form" class="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/mvzboeda" method="POST">
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="name">Name</label>
                    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="topic">What's it about?</label>
                <select id="topic" name="topic">
                    <option>A correction</option>
                    <option>A question</option>
                    <option>A car or guide request</option>
                    <option>Something else</option>
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="message">Message</label>
                <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" required placeholder="If it's a correction, tell me which car and which page."></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send</button>
        </form>
    </section>
</main>
